---
// EthicsCreditSpiral: generated bilingual SVG figure (site tokens only, polygon arrowheads, no fixed ids).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 300;
---
<figure class="ecs">
  <div class="ecs-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A medical bill lowers the credit score, employers screen by credit so you get no job, more bills go unpaid, and the score drops again.">
      <text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>The credit-to-unemployment spiral</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vòng xoáy từ điểm tín dụng tới thất nghiệp</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="46" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>One medical bill starts it, then each lap makes the next one worse.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một hóa đơn y tế mở màn, rồi mỗi vòng làm vòng sau tệ hơn.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="80" width="190" height="70" rx="8" class="box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="receipt" x={44} y={115} size={24} />
      <text x="66" y="110" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Unexpected</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hóa đơn y tế</tspan></text>
      <text x="66" y="128" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>medical bill</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bất ngờ</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow "><path d="M 210 115 L 245.0 115.0" /><polygon points="250,115 243.7,118.0 243.7,112.0" /></g>
      <rect x="250" y="80" width="190" height="70" rx="8" class="box hot" />
      <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={274} y={115} size={24} />
      <text x="296" y="110" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Credit score</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Điểm tín dụng</tspan></text>
      <text x="296" y="128" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>drops</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tụt xuống</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow red"><path d="M 440 115 L 475.0 115.0" /><polygon points="480,115 473.7,118.0 473.7,112.0" /></g>
      <rect x="480" y="80" width="190" height="70" rx="8" class="box hot" />
      <DiagramIcon name="fail" x={504} y={115} size={24} />
      <text x="526" y="110" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>Employers screen</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhà tuyển dụng lọc</tspan></text>
      <text x="526" y="128" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>by credit: no job</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>theo điểm: mất việc</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow red"><path d="M 670 115 L 705.0 115.0" /><polygon points="710,115 703.7,118.0 703.7,112.0" /></g>
      <rect x="710" y="80" width="170" height="70" rx="8" class="box hot" />
      <DiagramIcon name="money" x={734} y={115} size={24} />
      <text x="756" y="110" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>More bills</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thêm hóa đơn</tspan></text>
      <text x="756" y="128" class="bh"><tspan data-lang-en>go unpaid</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không trả nổi</tspan></text>
      <g class="arrow red"><path d="M 795 150 L 795 200 L 345 200 L 345.0 155.0" /><polygon points="345,150 348.0,156.3 342.0,156.3" /></g>
      <text x="570" y="222" class="redtxt" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Each lap pushes the score lower</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi vòng đẩy điểm số xuống thấp hơn</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="262" class="muted"><tspan data-lang-en>Same shape elsewhere: recommendation feeds that narrow what you see, and pricing bots (next figure).</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng một hình dạng ở nơi khác: bảng tin gợi ý thu hẹp thứ bạn thấy, và bot định giá (hình tiếp theo).</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Follow the red arrow: after the first bill the loop feeds itself and no further bad luck is needed.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Theo mũi tên đỏ: sau hóa đơn đầu tiên, vòng lặp tự nuôi chính nó, không cần thêm rủi ro nào nữa.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ecs { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ecs-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ecs svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ecs text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ecs .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ecs .sub { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ecs .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ecs .box.hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .ecs .box.fix { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .ecs .box.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .ecs .bh { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ecs .bh.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .ecs .muted { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ecs .red { fill: var(--red); }
  .ecs .redtxt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ecs .num { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ecs .strike { text-decoration: line-through; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ecs .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); }
  .ecs .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .ecs .bar { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .ecs .arrow path { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ecs .arrow polygon { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ecs .arrow.red path { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .ecs .arrow.red polygon { fill: var(--red); }
  .ecs .arrow.gold path { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .ecs .arrow.gold polygon { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .ecs .arrow.dash path { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .ecs figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
